	(text "03 Cathode-current ADCs (ADS1115, differential across each 1 ohm shunt, +-0.256 V = 0-256 mA, 7.8 uA / count), rail and reference readback, ribbons W14-b / W15-b on the DGND island, soft tie. The FPGA does the over-current cut-off and the rail checks from these readings (rev_c/PLAN.md F1-F5)."
