	(text "ADC3 (0x4B): AIN0 -80 V (offset divider to VREF2V5: 0.99 V at -80 V, 2.45 V at 0 V), AIN1 +15 V (/6), AIN2 VREF2V5 direct (the external reference against the ADC's internal one), AIN3 +5 V (/2). ADDR: GND 0x48, VDD 0x49, SCL 0x4B (ADS1115 datasheet table 7-2); SDA (0x4A) unused, it is the DAC's."
