	)
	(text "Shunt inputs: 1k in each leg, 1u across the pair (80 Hz differential, anti-aliasing). Not 10k: the ADS1115's differential input impedance at +-0.256 V is about 710 kOhm, so 2x 10k would read about 2.8 % low (2x 1k: 0.3 %, calibrated out). The S3M across the shunt holds K below about 1.2 V; 1k limits a negative cathode transient into the input diodes to 10 mA at -10 V. ALERT/RDY unused (the FPGA polls)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
